        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/d876eecb50805866e3ff8967b46fca35.webp?t=1779945134\" width=316 height=30 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Toy Town, a toy has one goal, to be the last one standing in the shop, because the last toy standing, is always the best toy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Need to practice first? Play the Free For All mode, all the toys in Toy Town are covered by top notch insurance, so that when a toy is damaged, they'll get fixed right up and will be ready for their next battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Done practicing and ready to be the best? Hop into the battle royale mode, where you will fight 9 other real players, to be the last toy standing!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make sure to CUSTOMIZE your Toy before Battling! You wanna look your best don't ya?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/b31629917ae48d74805d08dc5c1b6adf.avif?t=1779945134\" width=305 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(I said look your BEST, not..)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/54ae6697b490cd3c63dfd6286363a75e.webp?t=1779945134\" width=316 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toy Town has many things that will suit everybody's needs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Rapid Rifle - Quick and Reliable Option<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/011167f10014372af249b4ea7f28d6ca.avif?t=1779945134\" width=262 height=202 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;<i>Rapid Rifle, the name doesn't do it enough justice!&quot; - Larry</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supreme Shotgun - A Solid Shooter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/d02412e49afad71698c80e1d48d2200b.avif?t=1779945134\" width=314 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;BLAM!! Well that's it! Finishes the job just like that!&quot; - Also Larry</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Bomb - Classic slapstick weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/c2fa570389afeb5ddeacba8d5285f2f4.avif?t=1779945134\" width=430 height=356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Can't go wrong wit it!&quot; - Cowboy Jim</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fabulous Frankfurter</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/add7f5c99eb3a2124596a60ba7eb559a.avif?t=1779945134\" width=478 height=400 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Great meal after a long day.&quot; - Skull Gang Greg</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More weapons are to come as Toy Town gains more residents!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/8c0d3a3abe8c920ceb17f22e0d8dabde.webp?t=1779945134\" width=316 height=30 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good question! Toy Town currently has 4 locations where you can compete to be the best, with more on the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The MEGA MAP</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/3f172e03f5f7cd2d5f0d624be89e9123.avif?t=1779945134\" width=1600 height=744 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Totally huge!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cheese Room</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/526e6025ffa09feeb335bb38d031e7b9.avif?t=1779945134\" width=1600 height=792 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Everything is made of CHEESE!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Floating Plains</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/bd2fb19c228b7af05d17eac7b7dec08b.avif?t=1779945134\" width=1122 height=634 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;The first battle royale map! Islands fall overtime, don't fall with them!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block World</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3898800/extras/1ad81b13cf63698d18c838c43843a55d.avif?t=1779945134\" width=693 height=440 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Our NEWEST Battle Royale location! Careful! The blocks fall off overtime!!&quot;</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More maps will come as Toy Town has more time to renovate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>So what are you waiting for? Book a trip to Toy Town and enjoy the Mayhem!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
